      "average_instruments": 15.0,
      "coverage": 0.999686,
      "turnover": 0.127159,
      "hit_ratio": 0.5341,
      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "regime_notes": "Full-history 20d IC/ICIR pass the benchmark gates, with 3,164 daily cross-sectional observations and all 15 assets on average. 2020-25 IC 0.042454 and 2028+ IC 0.033330 were positive; 2026+ was near zero (-0.000831), and 2029 YTD was materially negative (-0.066315), so recent regime drift warrants cautious use."
  },
